  <name>RUN BR01 Run off bike 20</name>
  <description>Etter 90 min sykkel — første 5 min RPE 4. — IMPORT: TP only accepts cycling ZWO — this file is sportType=bike so Library import works. After import: open workout → Build → set sport to Run → convert intensity to % Threshold Pace (keep the same % numbers). Power values are already % of run threshold (easy ~78%, threshold 100%).</description>
